[33mcommit e066c9342ba6a4dc2d49439c7603ef00c395d0ef[m
Author: Mohammad Zidane Kurnianto <mzidanek@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Oct 25 10:54:59 2026 +0700

    fix(accounts): smooth out Google OAuth login/register flow
    
    - Add PyJWT[crypto] to requirements.txt (allauth needs it to verify
      Google's id_token; was missing, caused a ModuleNotFoundError on
      the OAuth callback)
    - SOCIALACCOUNT_LOGIN_ON_GET=True skips the unstyled intermediate
      'continue to Google' confirmation page
    - SOCIALACCOUNT_EMAIL_AUTHENTICATION + AUTO_CONNECT so signing in
      with Google on an email that already has a local account logs
      into that account instead of re-running the signup flow

